   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 units of Obliterator.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Chaos Champion with no upgrades.\n- You must include 1 Chaos Champion upgraded to be a Warpsmith.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Obliterator as Troops choices instead of Heavy Support choices, but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- You may field Mutilators as Troops choices instead of Elites choices, but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- All Heavy Bolters that an Obliterator unit is equipped with are exchanged for Shrapnel Cannons for 0pts.",
